      "title": "Family plan is a coverage arrangement",
      "text": "A family plan may combine an adult base policy with term riders. It does not establish one universal family benefit, eligibility age or conversion deadline. The linked carrier brochure is an example of separate spouse and child benefits, not a Maryland-wide schedule.",
