      "title": "Juvenile ownership and consent are separate questions",
      "text": "Identify the legal owner, insured and beneficiary. Apply the actual transfer provisions and Maryland’s minor-consent rules, including the parent/guardian provision in §12-202, rather than assuming the child is the owner or that consent rules vanish.",
